Z||000011||terryk||09-25-1999||11:57 AM||||The 88's are certainly worth it if you really want a Fiero. Keep in mind though,  parts for the suspension are a bit higher in cost since they existed for only one year. Worth it though.<P>I plan on swapping a 3.8L SC into my 86 with the next few months. I already did one in my Ciera. I'll keep you posted.<P>Terry||||reg||1
